## Model card

- **Name:** Exo Free
- **Short description:** Unidentified-vendor free OpenCode Zen stealth slot (`opencode/exo-free`) that was briefly available in October 2026 and is now deprecated/retired; no official vendor model card or public benchmark disclosure found.
- **Provider / access:** Former OpenCode Zen free tier/slot. Local metadata states the slot is retired (HTTP 410 / `ModelDeprecated`) and the vendor was never identified.
- **Release / knowledge:** Not officially announced as a stable named model; short-lived preview window (~2026-10-06 to ~2026-10-09 per local metadata). Knowledge cutoff not stated.
- **IDs:** `exo-free`, `opencode/exo-free`.
- **Context window:** 1,048,576 tokens total (131,072 max output) per local metadata (unverifiable via official model card).
- **Modalities:** Text and image input; text output (per local metadata; unverifiable).
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-14):** Free $0/$0/$0 during limited preview; now deprecated/unavailable.
- **Architecture:** Proprietary/undisclosed. Vendor, checkpoint identity, and parameter count not publicly disclosed.

